<dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1916601011097288961":{"a":"<p>So many numbers. So few people understand how such few numbers do all the work.</p>\n<p>All repeating triple digit numbers divided by 37 equal the sum of those digits.<br>\n111 / 37 = 3<br>\n1+1+1 = 3<br>\n555 / 37 = 15</p>\n<p>What happens with more than 3 digits?<br>\n1111 / 37 = 30.027<br>\n11111 / 37 = 300.297<br>\n🧮 <a href=\"https://x.com/engineers_feed/status/1916569536788054346\">Tweet by @engineers_feed</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/engineers_feed/status/1916569536788054346\">https://x.com/engineers_feed/status/1916569536788054346</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1916601011097288961</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1916601011097288961\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-04-27T21:11:04Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1916619790120267942":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_HVkxEoXgGo\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_HVkxEoXgGo?enablejsapi=1\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_HVkxEoXgGo\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 1916619790120267942</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1916619790120267942\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-04-27T22:25:41Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>8</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1916619790120267942</dd>\n</dl>"